                                                "sense_id": "0b320d4e-cc97-39b6-a01f-1acfef10767d",
                                                "text": "The de minimis exemption, as it’s known, allowed shipments of goods worth $800 or less to come into the United States duty-free, often more or less skipping time-consuming inspections and paperwork."
                                            }
